{"id":"n62050-2-7","stage":1,"title":"선수 · 好手","scene":"恋爱话题","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62050-2-7-1","ko":"지수는 남자 친구가 또 바뀌었어.","zh":"智秀的男朋友又换人了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男朋友（与 친구 合用）","explanation":"남자 친구 合起来表示“男朋友”，这里的 남자 不单指一般男性。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"男朋友","explanation":"남자 친구：男朋友；-가 标记主语，说明智秀又换了男朋友。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구가","audio":"/audio/61bf5bfb043d2161ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"바뀌었어.","meaning":"改变，转变，更改","explanation":"바뀌다：改变，转变，更改；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"바뀌다","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61179","senseId":"3","lemma":"바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바뀌었어","audio":"/audio/61f9cf6fa37b7758d064.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"男性（남자 친구 合指“男朋友”）","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"男朋友（与 남자 合用）","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"남자 친구 是固定搭配，表示正在交往的男性伴侣。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"5207e639323d4244","term":"바뀌다","zh":"改变，转变，更改","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3","entryId":"61179","definition":"内容或状态等变化或变样。","pronunciation":["바뀌다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8e427802068d3a620d23.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62050-2-7-2","ko":"하여튼 지수는 남자 만나는 데는 선수라니까.","zh":"总之，智秀在谈恋爱这方面真是个老手。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하여튼","meaning":"总之、反正","explanation":"하여튼：不管怎样、总之；这里接着对智秀的恋爱经历下判断。","readings":[{"term":"하여튼","audio":"/audio/9edb4dff04d1a5352494.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72410","senseId":"1","lemma":"하여튼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하여튼","audio":"/audio/9edb4dff04d1a5352494.mp3"}},{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"남자","meaning":"男人","explanation":"남자：男人。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"3","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}},{"text":"만나는","meaning":"交往、约会","explanation":"남자를 만나다 在这里指和男性约会或交往；-는 修饰后面的 데。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나는","audio":"/audio/9faf4a9f9d1926495b77.mp3"}},{"text":"데는","meaning":"在……方面","explanation":"-는 데는 表示“在做某事这方面”；这里指与男性约会这方面。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"2","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데는","audio":"/audio/9cc42cbcded6eb4c0204.mp3"}},{"text":"선수라니까.","meaning":"是个老手、高手","explanation":"선수 在这里比喻经验丰富的人；-라니까 带有再次强调的语气。","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"2","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선수라니까","audio":"/audio/9a92c022ab50c120d1be.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9edb4dff04d1a535","term":"하여튼","zh":"反正，总之","audio":"/audio/9edb4dff04d1a5352494.mp3","entryId":"72410","definition":"不管怎么样。","pronunciation":["하여튼"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"一个女人的丈夫或恋人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"交往、约会","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"与某人建立或维持恋爱关系；本句指智秀和男性约会。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"方面、事情","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"依存名词，指某件事情或活动的方面；这里是谈恋爱方面。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"c4df0bdce9d53b7c","term":"선수","zh":"老手、高手","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3","entryId":"62050","definition":"比喻经常做某事、经验丰富的人；本句评价恋爱经验。","pronunciation":["선ː수"]}],"audio":"/audio/dfd8c2ca2041593c4306.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.345,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62050","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6519,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["总之，智秀在谈恋爱这方面真是个老手。","智秀的男朋友又换人了。","听说智秀和敏俊在交往呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀的男朋友又换人了。","听说智秀和敏俊在交往呢。","总之，智秀在谈恋爱这方面真是个老手。"],"answer":2}]}
